# Round 154: the VM's call-depth cap (VM_FRAMES_MAX 4096, frame 0 = the
# module) is a semantic the AOT now mirrors with an enter/leave bracket on
# every compiled function. Measured on the pinned VM: `down of 4094`
# (4095 nested frames) succeeds and `down of 4095` raises "call stack
# overflow" -- this fixture pins the last depth that succeeds; t268 pins
# the first that dies.
define down(n) as:
    if n == 0:
        return 0
    return 1 + (down of (n - 1))
print of (down of 4094)
print of "after"
